{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your team have booked a cozy hotel for the night, but something feels off...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As soon as you step into the elevator, you notice it malfunctioning. Is this hotel really <u>safe</u>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and collect items to navigate the Hotel of Horror and Abyss. Work with your team, communicate, help each other, and most importantly\u2014<u>stay alive</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every word matters with <strong>proximity voice chat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to escape the current floor while avoiding certain <strong>entities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay alert to your surroundings... even those you trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>roguelike</strong> game where you collect coins to purchase cosmetics and other upgrades.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Support &lt;3</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character customization included.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Proximity Voice Chat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Procedural Levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaderboard System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inventory System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/extras/HotelAbyssFaces.gif?t=1743449694\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For now up to 4 players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/extras/HotelAbyssCosmeticsShowcase.gif?t=1743449694\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect coins to unlock cosmetics!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customization Types:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">backpacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buttmarks / Text </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Faces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/extras/HotelAbyssFalldown.gif?t=1743449694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just make sure you <strong>don't fall down</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548760?t=1743449694","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/d10cc4a8d7819d7d107d7cfbe60359d44d51fc62/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743449694","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/97c8f006a078f4714302590dd9a2872dd0dddc86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743449694","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548760/97c8f006a078f4714302590dd9a2872dd0dddc86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743449694","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your team have booked a cozy hotel for the night, but something feels off...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As soon as you step into the elevator, you notice it malfunctioning. Is this hotel really <u>safe</u>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and collect items to navigate the Ho